Measurement output

Committed experiment output also quotes the corpora it measured: short
excerpts of markdown in experiments/D8-identity/results-*.txt, and formulas,
header text and sheet names from spreadsheets under experiments/E1-differential/,
experiments/E4-if-sum/ and experiments/W3-interop/. Those corpora are named in
CORPORA.md, and the quoted material remains under its upstream terms.
